WEBVTT

00:20:57.871 --> 00:21:01.079
and making it happen, like not expecting
others to make it happen for you.

00:21:01.663 --> 00:21:03.579
And I treasure that. Like,

00:21:03.579 --> 00:21:07.246
I think I learned more doing that
than I would have going to

00:21:07.246 --> 00:21:13.704
a lovely summer camp. But, you know,
we all learned we all find our way.

00:21:14.704 --> 00:21:19.038
I read that it never occurred to you to
attend college outside of Minnesota

00:21:19.038 --> 00:21:23.829
and you only applied to one school, the
University of St. Thomas in St. Paul.

00:21:24.246 --> 00:21:27.038
How come how come it didn't occur
to you that you could

00:21:28.163 --> 00:21:29.163
go out outside of Minnesota?

00:21:29.163 --> 00:21:30.704
It never occurred to me.